{
  "description": "Type the integration routes' log-stream errors. Convex moved log streams from /log_streams to /integrations and kept the error codes. Observed live, 2026-11-12. On a free-plan team: POST /integrations and POST /integrations/{id}/rotate_webhook_secret answer 403 LogStreamingNotEnabled. On a Professional team: a second POST /integrations of the same type answers 409 LogStreamAlreadyExists; GET, PATCH, DELETE /integrations/{id} and POST /integrations/{id}/rotate_webhook_secret answer 400 InvalidLogStreamId for a malformed id and 404 LogStreamDoesntExist for the id of a deleted stream.",
